    "ASIF layers" : {

    },
    "ASIF machines automatically use DiskImageKit layered snapshots. Linux virtual machines use the Custom Virtio GPU by default and can fall back to Apple graphics by turning this off. macOS virtual machines always use Apple's graphics stack." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASIF 虚拟机会自动使用 DiskImageKit 分层快照。Linux 虚拟机默认使用自定义 Virtio GPU；关闭此选项即可回退到 Apple 图形。macOS 虚拟机始终使用 Apple 图形栈。"
