    },
    "The accessory disconnected before the connection finished. Reconnect it to the Mac and approve it for EZVM again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配件在连接完成前已断开。请将它重新连接到 Mac，并再次授权 EZVM 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The guest could not initialize this USB device. Safely reconnect the device and try again; this device class may not support passthrough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客体系统无法初始化此 USB 设备。请安全地重新连接设备后重试；此类设备可能不支持直通。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host did not accept the network attachment. Check the selected interface and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "主机未接受此网络连接。请检查所选网络接口后重试。" } }
      }
    },
    "The host disconnected this network adapter. Check the selected interface, VPN, and network access, then reconnect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "主机断开了此网络适配器。请检查所选网络接口、VPN 和网络访问，然后重新连接。" } }
      }
    },
    "The image will be saved and reused for future virtual machines." : {

    },
    "The password stays in this Mac’s Keychain until you confirm that macOS setup completed. It is never stored in the virtual machine bundle." : {

    },
    "The running virtual machine no longer has an available USB controller. Restart the virtual machine and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在运行的虚拟机不再有可用的 USB 控制器。请重新启动虚拟机后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed-release list updates automatically via IPSW.me. Downloads come directly from Apple; EZVM performs the final host compatibility check before installation." : {

    },
    "The snapshot transaction is finishing and can no longer be cancelled" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照事务正在安全完成，现已无法取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The USB device is already attached. Wait for the device list to refresh before trying another action." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 USB 设备已经连接。请等待设备列表刷新后再进行其他操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The USB device is no longer connected to this virtual machine. Reconnect it to the Mac and approve it for EZVM again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 USB 设备已不再连接到该虚拟机。请将它重新连接到 Mac，并再次授权 EZVM 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The virtual machine is running. Shut it down before creating or restoring snapshots." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机正在运行。请先将其关机，再创建或恢复快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The virtual USB controller disconnected the accessory before the connection finished. Reconnect it and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟 USB 控制器在连接完成前断开了配件。请重新连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These values come from the macOS 27 entitlements in the running EZVM process." : {

    },
    "This accessory is being used by macOS or another app. Release it from the accessory menu, then choose it for EZVM again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此配件正被 macOS 或其他 App 使用。请先在配件菜单中释放它，然后再次选择由 EZVM 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This accessory is no longer in a state that can be attached. Disconnect it from the Mac, reconnect it, and approve it for EZVM again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此配件当前无法连接。请将它从 Mac 拔下后重新连接，并再次授权 EZVM 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build does not include the Accessory Access entitlement required for USB passthrough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此构建未包含 USB 直通所需的配件访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This leaves little memory for macOS and may cause heavy swapping." : {

    },
    "This snapshot chain is deep. Audit it before adding more snapshots, keep an exported backup, and remove unneeded leaf branches. EZVM does not compact layered ASIF disks in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此快照链层数较深。继续添加快照前请先审计完整性、保留导出备份，并删除不再需要的叶子分支。EZVM 目前不能原地压缩分层 ASIF 磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This virtual machine has no USB controller. Stop it and verify its configuration before trying again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
